    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Convent Gate is an exclusive new development of 28 beautifully designed A Rated homes located on the edge of Claremorris town, adjacent to the N60 (The Castlebar/Westport) Road. It is a mere stroll from the development to the town itself.\r\n\r\nThis thoughfully planned development offers a mix of 2,3 and 4 bedroom homes designed for modern family living, energy efficiency, and long-term comfort. Built to the highest standards, each home combines elegant design, quality craftmanship, and future proof technology.\r\n\r\nClaremorris is a vibrant, welcoming and strategically located town in the heart of County Mayo, offering the perfect balance of modern convenience, natural beauty and strong community spirit.\r\n\r\nRegister Your Interest Now - www.conventgate.ie\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "BER Rating – A Rated.\r\n10 Year Home bond Structural Warranty.\r\nTruss Roof.\r\nRoof Slates.\r\nPVC Soffits, Facias, Gutters & Downpipes.\r\nComposite Front Door.\r\nPVC Energy Efficient Windows & Patio Doors.\r\nAir to Water Heat Pump.\r\nUnderfloor heating downstairs/Radiators upstairs.\r\nFully Fitted Kitchens with Appliances.\r\nTiled Kitchen Flooring & Backsplashes.\r\nAll Bathroom Floors and Partial Walls finished with Ceramic Tiles.\r\nP.C. Sum of €1,200 for tiling.\r\nTimber Flooring throughout Upstairs.\r\nP.C. Sum of €800 for timber flooring upstairs.\r\nWhite Gloss finish doors, skirting and architrave with high-quality ironmongery.\r\nBrick Paving finish to driveways.\r\nGardens levelled and seeded.\r\nConcrete boundary walls, capped and plastered.\r\nPainted internally and externally."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From the square in Claremorris, take the Castlebar Road (R320) for 400m. Continue onto Convent Road, (N60) for 270m. \"Convent Gate\" development is on your left hand side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Highly recommended and by appointment only"
      }
    ],
